msgid "Type your local AI app's address on this computer (for example http://127.0.0.1:11434), then Look. It must allow this page to ask it: the manual says how."
msgstr "输入这台电脑上本地 AI 应用的地址（例如 http://127.0.0.1:11434），然后点击“查找”。它必须允许此页面访问：手册里有具体做法。"

#: ide/aisetup.inc
msgid "This computer: {total} of memory; {free} free for a model now ({most} with other apps closed)."
msgstr "这台电脑：内存共 {total}；现在可供模型使用的有 {free}（关闭其他应用后可达 {most}）。"

# legal
#: ide/aisetup.inc
msgid "No AI model answered on this computer. A local AI app is a free program you install: it keeps AI models on your computer and answers RAI here, so what you ask stays on this computer, unless the app is set up to pass it on. Install one, add a model in it, start it, then go Back and Look Again — or type its address below if it uses another one."
msgstr "没有 AI 模型在这台电脑上响应。本地 AI 应用是一个你自己安装的免费程序：它把 AI 模型保存在你的电脑里，并在本机回答 RAI，因此你的提问会留在这台电脑上，除非该应用被设置为把它转交出去。请安装一个，在其中添加模型并启动它，然后点击“上一步”再点击“重新查找”——如果它使用其他地址，也可以在下方输入它的地址。"

