#: ide/mcp.inc
msgid "RapidR sends none of this anywhere, but the AI app may pass what it reads to the company that makes it, under that company's terms. A program can show private data, yours or other people's, and clicking in it acts as you: a real Send, Pay or Delete button does it for real, so use test data. Many AI apps are for adults only: if you are under 18, set this up with a parent or teacher. Connect only AI apps you trust."
msgstr "RapidR 不会把这些内容发送到任何地方，但 AI 应用可能会把它读取到的内容转交给开发它的公司，并受该公司条款约束。程序可能显示私人数据（你的或他人的），而在其中点击就相当于以你的身份操作：真实的“发送”“支付”或“删除”按钮会真的执行，所以请使用测试数据。许多 AI 应用仅限成年人使用：如果你未满 18 岁，请在家长或老师的陪同下进行设置。只连接你信任的 AI 应用。"

#: ide/mcp.inc
msgid "Share only what you may share: schoolwork, an employer's code or someone else's licensed code may not be yours to share. Turn this off to disconnect every AI agent. Studio keeps a list of what they did in this browser only; Clear Activity removes it."
msgstr "只分享你可以分享的内容：作业、雇主的代码或他人受许可保护的代码可能不归你分享。关闭此项即可断开所有 AI 代理。Studio 只在此浏览器中保留它们所做操作的列表；“清除活动”可将其删除。"

# legal
